# Impeccable design skill. Tracked on purpose: .impeccable/design.json and every
# .impeccable/live/config.json. Everything else under live/ is per-session runtime
# state (sessions, annotations, locks, server and root manifests), plus the dev-only
# plugin live mode injects while a session is running.
**/.impeccable/live/*
!**/.impeccable/live/config.json
**/.impeccable/hook.cache.json
**/.impeccable/hook.pending.json
**/.impeccable/config.local.json
**/.impeccable-live.json
**/.impeccable-live/
**/plugins/impeccable-live.client.ts
